WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:04.291
Unit twenty-three. Good Posture!

2
00:00:05.265 --> 00:00:09.064
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:09.114 --> 00:00:12.285
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.335 --> 00:00:15.854
Today we learn about Good Posture. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.954 --> 00:00:20.587
Posture. Say it with me. Posture!

6
00:00:24.081 --> 00:00:27.314
Back. Say it with me. Back!

7
00:00:30.804 --> 00:00:34.171
Sit. Say it with me. Sit!

8
00:00:37.668 --> 00:00:41.285
Stand. Say it with me. Stand!

9
00:00:44.773 --> 00:00:48.040
Bag. Say it with me. Bag!

10
00:00:51.574 --> 00:00:55.241
Straps. Say it with me. Straps!

11
00:00:58.722 --> 00:01:02.155
Spine. Say it with me. Spine!

12
00:01:05.659 --> 00:01:08.992
Stretch. Say it with me. Stretch!

13
00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:21.119
Good posture helps my back and spine. I sit and stand up straight. I carry my school bag with both straps and stretch after sitting a long time.

14
00:01:21.169 --> 00:01:22.378
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:28.921
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.971 --> 00:01:30.121
Sit!

17
00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:36.333
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.383 --> 00:01:37.533
Spine!

19
00:01:38.421 --> 00:01:43.704
Did you know? A heavy bag on one shoulder can pull your back to one side!

20
00:01:43.754 --> 00:01:45.784
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:54.175
Think and answer. Why should you use both straps on your bag?

22
00:01:54.225 --> 00:01:55.375
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.510 --> 00:02:01.397
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.447 --> 00:02:04.104
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

